From f9d7a64f90e923e3471eb9d9f5337a6b1aa0fa6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:39:34 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed settings window

Rebuilds the settings window in QML following the redesign: a search field and App / Media / System categories on the left, and pages of plain-language rows with info icons, ending in Advanced Options that list the core VLC options of the category.

VLCSettings (VLC.Dialogs) gives QML access to any VLC option: its value, type, texts and choices, writing values and saving the configuration file, listing the core options of VLC sections, and picking files or folders. prefsDialog() now asks the interface to toggle the new window; the original dialog stays available as classicPrefsDialog(). Adds ColorSchemeModel::setScheme() for the theme switch and icon glyphs for the settings categories.
